    "body": "Hi,\n\nI have a 2020 BMW M340i (G20) with iDrive 7 (MGU) and MGU Store installed.\n\nI installed the following components from MGU Store:\n\n* RideTube 0.3.7\n* RideTube Service (jap-ridetube-d) 0.3.8\n* Node.js 22 (22.23.4)\n\nThe RideTube app opens successfully, but I get this message:\n\n“The RideTube service (jap-ridetube-d) is not running.”\n\nIn MGU Store, the service previously showed this error:\n\n“jap-ridetube-d.service is not healthy (ActiveState=failed, NRestarts 20 -> 20).”\n\nI have already tried restarting iDrive and uninstalling/reinstalling RideTube and its service, but the problem persists.\n\nCould you please help me identify the cause? Are there any known compatibility issues with the BMW M340i G20, or additional requirements I should check?\n\nI have attached a photo of the error.\n\nThank you for your work![![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dd27a230-5c99-4cdd-a650-918561a6a31f)]()",
